  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting Media Freedom in BiH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Protecting Media Freedom in BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ej tillg&#xe4;nglig</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the intervention is to strengthen independent media organizations in Bosnia and Herzegovina by enhancing their organizational, managerial, and editorial capacities to ensure sustainable, transparent, and high-quality media production.
A more resilient, transparent, and professional media environment will contribute to democratic governance, public accountability, and civic engagement in BiH.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the intervention is to strengthen independent media organizations in Bosnia and Herzegovina, by enhancing their organizational, managerial, and editorial capacities to ensure sustainable, transparent, and high-quality media production.
A more resilient, transparent, and professional media environment will contribute to democratic governance, public accountability, and civic engagement in BiH.</narrative>
  </description>
